  "description": "The Fire Mountain is an affordable hardtail mountain bike built for first trails, growing confidence, and the moment a casual ride becomes a full blown habit. Born from Kona’s Pacific Northwest mountain bike heritage, it pairs a 100mm suspension fork with a dependable 8 speed drivetrain and mechanical disc brakes to keep rough terrain, loose dirt, and unpredictable conditions manageable. Size specific wheels give riders a confident fit across the range, with 26” wheels on the XS, 27.5” wheels on the S, and 29” wheels on sizes M through XL. Consider it your introduction to mountain biking by trial, trail, and fire. The mountains are calling, and this is where the origin story begins.",
